      "writtenOn": "2023-12-11T14:04:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Though the new `DiscoveryRequest#setSubtype()` API accepts only a single subtype label, there are chances that two subtypes can result in here because we need to support the legacy comma-separate \u003ctype,subtype\u003e format (e.g. \"_http._tcp,_printer)\" in the \"serviceType\".\n\nBut probably we should ignore the subtype specified in serviceType when a non-null subtype is already set with `DiscoveryRequest#setSubtype`. I changed the code here to ensure that only one subtype is accepted in this case. PTAL",
